+double_underline: SGR = SGR(21, 24)
+
+#: Faint (decreased intensity) text (SGR 2/22).
+faint: SGR = SGR(2, 22)
+
+#: Inverse/reverse video text, foreground and background swapped
+#: (SGR 7/27).
+inverse: SGR = SGR(7, 27)
